NOTES\P1. Dimensions in millimetres unless stated. All dimensions indicative and to be confirmed in detailed design.\P2. Two mirrored dwellings, each with living room 4.8 x 5.0 m, dining room 4.8 x 5.0 m, bedroom 2.8 x 3.5 m, bathroom, utility / stor
  3
age, conservatory and side patio.\P3. Front entrance revised per hand sketch: shared hallway projects 2.5 m beyond the front wall, with 1680 mm French double doors onto a full front porch 4.0 x 3.0 m (attached and roofed).\P4. Conservatory 5.0 x 4.0 
  1
m and front door opening 1680 mm taken from the Phase 1 Measurement Schedule (items A3, A4) - verify on site.\P5. Wall thicknesses assumed for concept: external 300, party wall 200, partitions 100.
